In `.tmp_ref/theboringtv-lgwebos/style.css` (lines 18-32, 77-78, 161-162):
```css
/* top bar */
#top { position: fixed; top: 44px; left: 72px; right: 72px; display: flex; align-items: center; z-index: 5;
  transition: opacity .3s, transform .3s; }
.avatar { width: 60px; height: 60px; border-radius: 50%; background: #8ab4f8; color: #0e1014; display: flex;
  align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 600; margin-right: 18px; }
