## 4. Preservation of Critical DOM Sinks & Invariants

### 4.1 Zero DOM Sinks Verification
Our grep search across `app/js/` confirmed that **zero instances of `.innerHTML =` or `.outerHTML =` exist in runtime code**. All occurrences are documentation comments confirming strict safe DOM construction.

### 4.2 Non-Negotiable DOM Elements Inventory
