| **Player Overlays** | `#player-buffering`, `#player-buffering-text`, `#player-error-dialog`, `#player-error-title`, `#player-error-message`, `#player-error-retry-btn`, `#player-error-switch-btn`, `#player-error-exit-btn`, `#player-subtitles-modal`, `#player-subtitles-list`, `#player-subtitles-close-btn`, `#player-server-modal`, `#player-server-list`, `#player-server-close-btn`, `#player-feedback-toast`, `#player-feedback-text`, `#player-feedback-icon` | Buffering, error modal, subtitle/server selectors | `player.js`, `test-m5.js`, adversarial suites |

