## 5. CSS Architecture Mapping (`app/css/`)

The target stylesheet architecture uses 4 modular files in `app/css/`:

1. **`tokens.css`**: Design tokens, color palette, typography hierarchy, TV-safe margins (96px horizontal, 54px vertical), card dimensions, focus halos.
   - *Action required*: Modernize legacy `--color-bg-base: #0e1014;` or provide dual variable so `app/test-ui.js` passes.
2. **`layout.css`**: Viewport layout (1920x1080), `#bg`, `#bgBlur`, `#shade`, `#top` / `.app-header` styling, auto-hide `.scrolled` state, `.views-container` stacking order.
   - *Action required*: Add `#top` styling matching `theboringtv-lgwebos/style.css` lines 18-32, harmonize `.scrolled #shade` with dual gradient + color.
3. **`components.css`**: Card components (`.card`, `.pic`, `.ttl`, `.chip`, `.cap`), pill tabs, badges, buttons, modal dialogs, virtual keyboard.
