4. **`navigation.css`**: Focus indicators (`.focus`, `.focused`, `:focus`), 5px white contact halo, scale transforms, D-pad navigation styling.
   - *Action required*: Include `.avatar.focus`, `.tab.focus`, `.ico.focus`, `#weather.focus`.

Optionally, `app/css/style.css` can be added as a unified entry point or reference alias if desired, while keeping the 4 existing modular CSS files imported in `app/index.html`.

---

